.TH CHM-USER-SETUP 1
.SH NAME
chm-user-setup \\- initialize and create Chimera local accounts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chm-user-setup
.RI { init | create-root | create-user NAME | create-admin NAME | files }
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates local passwd, shadow, group and gshadow databases. Passwords are entered interactively and are never supplied on the command line.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
Initialize account databases.
.TP
.B create-root
Create or reset the UID 0 root account and prompt for its password.
.TP
.B create-user NAME
Create a normal local user and private group.
.TP
.B create-admin NAME
Create a local user and grant the chimera-admin administrative role.
.TP
.B files
Print account database paths.
